== 8.7 Chapter 8 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [Management is best defined as],
  [the process of planning, organising, staffing, directing and controlling resources to achieve objectives],
  [giving orders],
  [selling goods],
  [keeping records]
)

#mcq(2, [The management function concerned with setting objectives in advance is],
  [planning],
  [staffing],
  [organising],
  [controlling]
)

#mcq(3, [Grouping activities and assigning authority is],
  [organising],
  [directing],
  [staffing],
  [planning]
)

#mcq(4, [Recruiting and training staff is the function of],
  [planning],
  [controlling],
  [staffing],
  [organising]
)

#mcq(5, [Comparing actual performance with the plan is],
  [controlling],
  [directing],
  [planning],
  [staffing]
)

#mcq(6, [The document that shows the structure of an organisation is the],
  [invoice],
  [ledger],
  [balance sheet],
  [organisation chart]
)

#mcq(7, [Top management is mainly concerned with],
  [filing],
  [paying wages],
  [long-term policy and the whole firm],
  [daily supervision]
)

